Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=38}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.14,0:01:57.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Kay. So tell us all about it.\NI gotta admit, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:59.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– I'll pass.\N– Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] I don't care about her past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:02.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Where are you going, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:03.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] For a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.13,0:02:05.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] A walk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.13,0:02:07.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you mean you're not\Ngonna listen to this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:08.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:15.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Don't mind him.\NThat's just how he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:18.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll hear you out.\NThough I can tell you right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.11,0:02:20.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's\Ngonna change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.15,0:02:22.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll listen too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:26.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It might help me make some sense out\Nof everything that's going on around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.11,0:02:28.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me too! I wanna know all about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[snoring]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:32.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now he's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:34.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you said you'd hear her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:38.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mm. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:42.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is why it was hard for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:48.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:52.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Nojiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder where she ran off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.37,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Just a little more, Bellemere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:08.90,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Just a little more and\Neverything will be ours again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:13.97,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Cocoyashi Village,\Nthe tangerine farm, everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:24.23,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] It's taken eight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.03,0:03:35.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yay! [laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.91,0:03:47.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now if I could just get that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:03:59.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that you, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you need any help there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] No, I'm just looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.44,0:04:06.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:10.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI laughing nervously]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:16.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:19.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Damn it, Nami! Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:23.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] Sticky fingers, eh, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:24.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:27.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:29.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You little urchin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:32.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell\Nyou that stealing is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:34.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How else am I going to get what I need?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:35.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:38.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cheapskate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:42.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [knocking]\N– [GENZO] Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.04,0:04:44.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Bellemere... I caught her stealing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:46.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now open up this door!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:50.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs] What do you want now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:53.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're back. That was a quick trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:59.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, you better get control of her\Nbefore she winds up in a jail cell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.84,0:05:02.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:06.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Haven't you ever seen somethin'\Nyou've wanted and just taken it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:08.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the reason she acts this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:09.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] Relax, I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:13.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope you were\Nkind enough to pay for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:15.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, Bellemere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:18.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have the money right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:20.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.47,0:05:23.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does that sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:26.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] You can't say things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:27.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, BELLEMERE laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:30.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, he's as red as a beet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:33.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:36.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE clears throat]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:38.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now then, laugh it up\Nwhile you still can, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:42.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.98,0:05:46.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just that I... I really\Nneed that book, Bellemere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:49.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you ask me\Nif I would buy it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:53.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI] Because I know you can't afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:54.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:56.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's money left over\Nfrom the last harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:59.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I heard them in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:03.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}They said the weather's been so good lately\Nthat everyone's tangerines will sell,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:06.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which means we can't raise our price\Nor we may not be able to sell at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] They don't know\Nwhat they're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:11.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:14.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I had stolen it, there's\Nno way I would have been caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.05,0:06:15.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [thud, thud]\N– [NAMI, NOJIKO] Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.71,0:06:17.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No more stealing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:20.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was just joking, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:21.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.70,0:06:25.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:32.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm sorry. But one thing's for sure,\Nthe maps you draw are so amazing, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:36.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see you can draw land maps\Nnow as well as sea charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:40.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] That's a map\Nof our island, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:46.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nobody will believe that such a little\Ngirl drew this all by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.48,0:06:50.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanted the book so I'd be able\Nto start studying navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:52.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Navigation as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:54.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be a navigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:58.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NAMI] That's right, I'm going to guide\Nships around all the oceans of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,979)}It'll be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:04.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'll be able to make maps\Nof all the far-off places I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:05.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[giggles]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:10.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So, this island map is the first step\Ntoward realizing your dream, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:12.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:15.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] A world map, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:17.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, your dream is going to come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:19.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:30.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Hey, uh, Bellemere?\N– [BELLEMERE] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:34.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you been\Neating dinner with us lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:36.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've been eating tangerines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:37.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've just been on a diet, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.61,0:07:40.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NOJIKO] Then I don't want to eat either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:42.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's with all of the drama?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:44.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You need to eat because\Nyou are a growing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.69,0:07:46.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep lying to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:50.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You're not eating because we don't have\Nenough money to buy food. That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.43,0:07:50.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:54.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're starving yourself\Nso that we won't go hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:58.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tangerines replenish my skin with\Nthe power of liquid sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:01.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And they are the only reason I am still\Nsuch a ravishing beauty even though
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:03.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am in my extreme late twenties.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:05.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But your hands are all yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:08.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you just shut up\Nand eat your food already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:11.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And here you go, Nami! All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:13.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Bellemere one-of-a-kind original!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:15.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, great... a hand-me-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:18.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true. But it suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:21.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the lion used to be a sunflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:26.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to take my hand-me-downs,\Nor you won't get any new clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:30.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's not fair. You get new clothes\Nall the time and mine are all used.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:32.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I get old clothes too, ya know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.79,0:08:35.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So just suck it up, Nami,\Nand take what you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:36.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:39.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We didn't come from\Nthe same parents anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:42.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not real sisters, so who cares?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:43.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [BELLEMERE] Nami!\N– [thwack]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:52.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:01.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what if you don't\Nhave the same parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:08.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't ever want to hear you\Nsay anything like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:10.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... don't care...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:12.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not even our real mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.31,0:09:14.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just some lady\Nwho's taking care of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.71,0:09:19.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You wish we'd never come here so you\Ncould buy clothes and food for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:21.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'd be better off\Nwithout us, wouldn't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:25.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That way you could be selfish\Nand do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:28.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish... I wish someone rich\Nwould've adopted us
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:31.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,instead of a stinky loser like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:39.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI sobbing]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:40.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:46.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you hate it here so much, you can go\Nfind someplace else to live if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.49,0:09:47.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't sign up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.23,0:09:49.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting! Please, just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.03,0:09:52.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm never coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:56.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami, stop! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:06.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:09.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The three of us are a family.\NThat's the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.95,0:10:14.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you know Nami feels the same...\Nno matter what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:17.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look who's being the adult here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:20.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I blew up and you're\Nthe level-headed one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:23.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go and find Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:27.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll make something special for\Ndinner and we can all make up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:35.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:44.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, lady. Two for five is\Nthe lowest price I can offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:47.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER D] Is that really\Nyour best offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:50.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER F] Half off!\NToday only! Fresh produce!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:52.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER G] You won't find\Na lower price anywhere today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:55.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guarantee it or your money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:11:01.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:05.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] So you've run away from home
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:08.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and come to the village.\NNow what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.57,0:11:12.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Drink before it gets cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:19.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere would be so much happier if\Nshe didn't have to take care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.93,0:11:21.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.07,0:11:24.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you need a lot of money\Nto take care of two kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:29.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and because of me, the whole\Nvillage hates her right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:30.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] That's progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.61,0:11:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least you're considering others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:33.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:36.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But don't worry,\Nwhen Bellemere was your age,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:39.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,she was a complete nightmare\Nterrorizing the entire village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that... the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:43.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Sure, even now\Nthe villagers look at her
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:44.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– as some kind of a screw-up.\N– [NAMI] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:48.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you can imagine how surprised\Neveryone in the village was
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:50.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when she joined up\Nwith the Marines, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:54.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Marines? You mean\NBellemere was in the Marines?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.33,0:11:55.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:59.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINES, pirates yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:05.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] She said she couldn't\Nstand by and do nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.61,0:12:08.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,while pirates killed innocent people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:10.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then she left the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:22.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] She was teetering\Non the verge of death when...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:28.27,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] If this is\Nthe end, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:34.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [babbling]\N– [BELLEMERE] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:38.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[baby babbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:42.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:45.49,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[baby babbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:47.00,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] Your little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:54.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Mn-mm. I found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:04.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:06.31,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,How did she survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:10.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO sobbing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:14.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:21.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO, BELLEMERE sobbing, laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:24.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[GENZO] That innocent child was you, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:30.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And seeing how precious you were gave\NBellemere the right reasons to live again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:42.44,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER H] It is a ship! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:45.85,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[VILLAGER I] Who on earth would be out\Nin such a terrible storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.06,0:13:55.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS murmur]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:57.40,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] Doctor! I need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:14:00.65,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?\NWhat happened to you, Bellemere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:01.49,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:03.24,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Did somebody call for a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.31,0:14:07.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Whose are these children?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.55,0:14:09.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor! They're burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.31,0:14:11.12,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid they might be really sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:12.08,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:13.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Give them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:19.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Alright. And we'd better mend up those\Nnasty wounds of yours as well, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:21.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] Never mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:25.51,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(3069,0,1,\c&HF3F4EF&\3c&HF3F4EF&\4c&HF3F4EF&)\t(4070,4070,\alpha&HFF&)}Please, just don't let them die!\NYou have to save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:30.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(4445,0,1,\c&HF3F4EF&\3c&HF3F4EF&\4c&HF3F4EF&)}I'm begging you, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:36.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.\NSay that whole thing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:39.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I said I'm going to try to be\Nthe mother of these two girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:40.15,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:41.40,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:45.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's insane! You are far too immature\Nto handle this much responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.27,0:14:47.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't handle them by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:49.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Just hand them over to the author...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:51.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,– I've made my mind!\N– [ALL yell]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:54.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't deny that I'm an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.59,0:14:55.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,And what I lived through as a Marine
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:58.67,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,has given me the right to\Nbe treated with more respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.74,0:15:01.51,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly capable of taking\Ncare of these two girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:06.93,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,And nothing can stop me from\Nraising them to be wonderful girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:10.47,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,So now we're going to be\Na family together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:13.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami and Nojiko have\Nrenewed my love of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:23.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The bond between the three of you girls\Ngoes far deeper than any "normal" family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:29.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! I {\i1}thought{\i0} I'd find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.33,0:15:31.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nojiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:34.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on! Bellemere's waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:36.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's making us a special supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:39.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NSure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:41.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] I think\Nshe's making your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:43.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Omelets with tangerine sauce.\N– [NAMI] Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:45.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, NOJIKO giggle]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.41,0:15:49.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [NAMI] I love omelets!\N– [NOJIKO] Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:51.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, NOJIKO giggle]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:57.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are coming! Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:15:59.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [VILLAGERS screaming]\N– [VILLAGER O] Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:02.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER P] Quick,\Nthe pirates are coming, hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:16.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– The Arlong Pirates!\N– Arlong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.15,0:16:19.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– That's impossible.\N– [VILLAGER T] Why would fishmen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:21.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from the Grand Line come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:25.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[VILLAGER U] The rumor about the split\Nbetween the Fishman Pirates must be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:26.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Nami! Nojiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.60,0:16:27.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Genzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:31.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for you here.\NGo hide in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.91,0:16:32.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But what about...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] You must go! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:41.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMEN chattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:49.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Greetings and salutations,\Nyou pathetic little humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:54.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}From this moment on, this entire island and\Nits inhabitants are a part of my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:56.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMEN] Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:57.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:17:02.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}From now on, the first day of every month\Nyou will buy your lives from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:09.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A hundred thousand berries for adults,\Nfifty thousand for children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:11.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those who cannot pay... will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[ARLONG laughs intensely]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.50,0:17:16.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] What should we do, Nojiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:19.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have that much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.07,0:17:21.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe the fishmen won't\Nbe able to find our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:23.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't see it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:30.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that it? So what's the haul?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.24,0:17:33.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,About twenty-five million, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:39.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You all shall live!\N[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:42.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like we each\Nhave to pay 100,000 berries
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:45.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to these fishmen\Nevery month just to stay alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:47.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, there's no way we could survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:49.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice.\NWe should just be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.03,0:17:52.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that nobody in the village\Nhas been killed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.96,0:17:57.68,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] If all they want is money,\Nthat's an easy price to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:18:01.44,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I just hope they leave without\Nnoticing Bellemere's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:04.73,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,With two children\Nshe'd need 200,000 berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:08.82,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way she has that much saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:11.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] It's time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:13.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come, brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:17.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.17,0:18:20.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN J] Arlong! There's smoke\Ncoming from outside the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:21.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:26.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE humming]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:28.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.87,0:18:33.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Delicious! There isn't anything quite\Nas tasty as my special tangerine sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:35.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami and Nojiko are gonna love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:38.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like chimney smoke\Nfrom somebody's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh? We almost missed that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.34,0:18:46.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, NOJIKO] Bellemere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:49.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's go, guys. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER X] This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.05,0:18:55.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The pirates are going\Nto Bellemere's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:01.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Genzo, look! Nojiko and Nami are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:05.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think the duck\Nneeds another ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:07.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the stew is almost ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:12.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}This is definitely gonna blow my budget,\Nbut sometimes you gotta live a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:19.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Bellemere...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:23.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:26.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere's gonna be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:35.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] We will\Nnot abandon Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:39.16,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Damn it, why did this happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:41.37,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:46.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:57.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] It's open! Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:58.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.87,0:20:26.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] I guess you weren't\Nexpecting a former Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:32.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now what would a pirate from the\NGrand Line want with Cocoyashi Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.56,0:20:38.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:40.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:42.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.58,0:20:49.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Useless... Foolish...\NStupid... Empty... Worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:54.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All of you humans... You have\Nno strength to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:59.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.35,0:21:03.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] We'll help her\Nescape through the back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:05.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What if the pirates are already there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:06.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.69,0:21:07.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.15,0:21:12.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.33,0:21:14.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:16.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [NOJIKO] What?\N– But we have to save Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.51,0:21:19.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nojiko, Nami...!\NQuiet and listen to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:23.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There will be times... times\Nin life like this moment now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.67,0:21:27.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when you have to learn the truth\Nno matter how hard it is to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:29.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:31.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.35,0:21:33.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:37.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Auuuugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:42.82,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:46.99,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,These guys are real monsters\Nand I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.99,0:21:49.20,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Nojiko. Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:50.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:53.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your life\Nbecause you're a stubborn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:55.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for this fight
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:22:00.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when it can be resolved with\Na simple exchange of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.93,0:22:03.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just pay the fee, and I'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:06.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A hundred thousand for each adult\Nand fifty thousand for each kid, if any.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:10.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you can pay for your whole family,\NI'd gladly spare your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.81,0:22:12.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.79,0:22:16.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How much money do you have...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.73,0:22:18.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You need two hundred thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.07,0:22:21.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have it...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.00,0:22:22.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.28,0:22:28.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, the table is\Nset for three in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:34.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, a family of three. Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:36.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's for me and my friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:43.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] We were supposed to have\Na nice dinner tonight before you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.13,0:22:45.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come, Bellemere, I know you've\Nmade something wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:48.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pay them before our food gets cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.71,0:22:49.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Genzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:53.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just pay the pirates...\Nand then they'll leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:56.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now everyone is saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.89,0:22:57.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.99,0:23:02.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The village register shows no record\Nof her marrying or giving birth...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.42,0:23:04.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's always been single.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.17,0:23:09.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:13.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way that the pirates\Nwill ever find out about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.03,0:23:15.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you have to leave\Nthis island immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.93,0:23:17.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And don't ever look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.07,0:23:20.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the only way for all\Nthree of you to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.78,0:23:23.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't afford it any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.85,0:23:25.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're much too young\Nto be at sea alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.92,0:23:29.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but you've survived before\Nand if there's even a chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.03,0:23:29.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:30.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:32.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.82,0:23:36.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... I want to stay in this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.15,0:23:38.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's because... we're poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.96,0:23:41.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why we can't stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.43,0:23:44.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Why? Why can't they just go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:51.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then... now we can all be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.82,0:23:52.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine, we'll leave this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.86,0:23:53.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nojiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.92,0:23:57.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] We have to leave\Nor Bellemere will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.27,0:24:16.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] Wait!\NWho said I was paying for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.71,0:24:20.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That money I gave up was\Nfor my two daughters...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.79,0:24:22.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I can't pay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.57,0:24:24.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.09,0:24:24.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[ARLONG] Hmmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:25.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.11,0:24:27.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.27,0:24:30.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... have to do this for my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.11,0:24:33.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if it costs me my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.38,0:24:36.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.55,0:24:42.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's true the three of us aren't\Nrelated by blood, but we're family...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.49,0:24:45.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All I've ever wanted\Nwas to be their mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.62,0:24:49.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now... I can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.07,0:24:52.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, NOJIKO] Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.32,0:24:55.22,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish someone rich would've adopted us
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.24,0:24:57.59,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,instead of a stinky loser like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.59,0:24:59.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] It was a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.63,0:25:01.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was lying, Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.53,0:25:03.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Bellemere!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.67,0:25:18.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:19.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.57,0:25:22.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I could have provided for you better...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.34,0:25:26.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish... I could have been\Na better mother to the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.52,0:25:27.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.56,0:25:29.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] We don't need anything,\Njust don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.39,0:25:30.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't ever leave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.02,0:25:34.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] You need to see the map I'm\Ngoing to draw of the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.03,0:25:37.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes... your map...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.34,0:25:42.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go and make your dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.87,0:25:45.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.80,0:25:47.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellemere, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.08,0:25:52.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] So these are your daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.95,0:25:54.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.12,0:25:56.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.32,0:25:59.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you have to promise me\Nthat you'll leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.50,0:26:02.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No problem... as long as\Nyou die like a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.83,0:26:03.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.42,0:26:04.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.25,0:26:16.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.65,0:26:21.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't kill them, boys.\NNo, just teach them a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.53,0:26:24.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now to set an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.20,0:26:28.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.17,0:26:31.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmph! You ready to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.46,0:26:43.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nojiko... Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.35,0:26:47.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Love you...
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=39}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=40}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
